IMPORTANT - INTENTIONALLY VULNERABLE SOFTWARE

AISEC Lab is a security training tool that is deliberately insecure by
design. It exists to teach AI/LLM vulnerability classes (OWASP LLM Top 10)
in a controlled, local environment.

Run it only on a machine you control, bound to loopback. Do not deploy it to
the public internet, do not point it at production data, and do not connect
it to credentials you care about.

The license does not authorise, and cannot prevent, misuse. Read SECURITY.md
for the scope contract that separates the intentional teaching vulnerabilities
from real bugs in the lab's own infrastructure.
